    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d807-a4">

                <pb facs="0842" n="792" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg792"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 150.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bartleman to Mr. Carpenter.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-14T10:00:00-04:27"><hi rendition="#italic">May 14,
                                1894</hi>—(10 a.m.)</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your letter dated Trinidad May 9 received to-day. Read my telegrams to your agent
                    at Ciudad Bolivar. Act with discretion and do not complicate matters.</p>
                <p>You are in error as to treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Richard M. Bartleman</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
